    "detailed_description": "<strong>In search of a new owner...</strong>.<br>This is a platform game in which you must overcome various obstacles to reach your destination.<br>Climbing on chairs, crossing over beds, and running around the human world is not easy for the bear toy.<br>Use your character control skills to complete the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Story</h2>.This is the story of a journey to escape the room and overcome all difficulties in search of a new owner. Enjoy the human world from the perspective of a toy.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114620/extras/240571f9688ba60b24d6d48d6725d2a4.avif?t=1749826941\" width=668 height=232 /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2>.The game is played from a third-person perspective, and the controls are simple: just use the move key and jump. However, there are several challenging situations that will make it difficult to reach your destination. Get the hang of it and proceed skillfully.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>In search of a new owner...</strong>.<br>This is a platform game in which you must overcome various obstacles to reach your destination.<br>Climbing on chairs, crossing over beds, and running around the human world is not easy for the bear toy.<br>Use your character control skills to complete the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Story</h2>.This is the story of a journey to escape the room and overcome all difficulties in search of a new owner. Enjoy the human world from the perspective of a toy.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114620/extras/240571f9688ba60b24d6d48d6725d2a4.avif?t=1749826941\" width=668 height=232 /></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2>.The game is played from a third-person perspective, and the controls are simple: just use the move key and jump. However, there are several challenging situations that will make it difficult to reach your destination. Get the hang of it and proceed skillfully.",
